{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35648","headline":"遣怀 · 李山甫","name":"遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长松埋涧底，郁郁未出原。\n孤云飞陇首，高洁不可攀。\n古道贵拙直，时事不足言。\n莫饮盗泉水，无爲天下先。\n智者与愚者，尽归北邙山。\n唯有东流水，年光不蹔闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}